<title>USA: IPO FILING - ChemGenics Pharmaceuticals Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - ChemGenics Pharmaceuticals Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    ChemGenics Pharmaceuticals Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $11-13/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  none</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    10,103,815</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		  Cowen &amp; Co</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  375,000 shrs Business: Company seeks to develop new drugs hrough its drug discovery genomics and advanced drug selection technologies. The company is based in Cambridge, Mass. </p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To repay a $3 million promissory note and for research and development, expansion of laboratory facilities, working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data:	     1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		$2,903,179	  $218,095</p>
<p>   - Net Income (Loss)  (2,395,282)	 (4,620,108)</p>
